Input: {"question": "Which award did Heidemaria Gürer receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 111, "text": "**French Government Honors Austrian Diplomat Heidemaria Gürer with Prestigious Knight of the Legion of Honour**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 113, "end": 398, "text": "Paris, France - In a ceremony held at the Élysée Palace yesterday, Austrian diplomat Heidemaria Gürer was awarded the esteemed Knight of the Legion of Honour, the highest French order of merit, for her outstanding contributions to international diplomacy and Franco-Austrian relations."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 399, "end": 609, "text": "Gürer, a seasoned diplomat with over two decades of experience, was recognized for her tireless efforts in promoting cultural exchange, economic cooperation, and mutual understanding between France and Austria."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 610, "end": 772, "text": "Her dedication to fostering strong bilateral ties has led to numerous breakthroughs in trade agreements, educational partnerships, and joint cultural initiatives."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 773, "end": 901, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this prestigious honor,\" Gürer said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 902, "end": 1029, "text": "\"It is a testament to the strong bonds between our nations and a recognition of the hard work and dedication of my team and I.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1030, "end": 1164, "text": "French President Emmanuel Macron, who presented the award to Gürer, praised her commitment to strengthening Franco-Austrian relations."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1165, "end": 1302, "text": "\"Heidemaria Gürer is an exemplary diplomat who has worked tirelessly to promote mutual understanding and cooperation between our nations."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1303, "end": 1427, "text": "Her dedication to the values of liberty, equality, and fraternity embodies the spirit of the Legion of Honour,\" Macron said."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1428, "end": 1687, "text": "According to data from the French Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Gürer's efforts have resulted in a significant increase in bilateral trade, with French exports to Austria rising by 25% and Austrian investments in France growing by 30% over the past five years."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1688, "end": 1751, "text": "Gürer's colleagues and peers have also praised her achievement."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1752, "end": 1869, "text": "\"Heidemaria is a true champion of international cooperation and a shining example of diplomatic excellence,\" said Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1870, "end": 1931, "text": "Wolfgang Sobotka, President of the Austrian National Council."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1932, "end": 2051, "text": "\"This award is a well-deserved recognition of her outstanding work and dedication to the people of Austria and France.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2052, "end": 2291, "text": "The Knight of the Legion of Honour, established in 1802 by Napoleon Bonaparte, is the highest French order of merit and is awarded to individuals who have demonstrated exceptional service to France or to the causes of freedom and humanity."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2292, "end": 2389, "text": "Gürer joins an esteemed group of recipients, including world leaders, artists, and humanitarians."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 75, "text": "Title: The Diplomatic Legacy of Heidemaria Gürer: A Testament to Excellence"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 77, "end": 181, "text": "In the realm of international diplomacy, few individuals have left an indelible mark on the world stage."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 182, "end": 264, "text": "Heidemaria Gürer, a seasoned diplomat with a storied career, is one such luminary."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 265, "end": 472, "text": "Her tireless efforts to foster global understanding, promote peace, and strengthen bilateral relations have earned her numerous accolades, including the prestigious Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 473, "end": 668, "text": "This esteemed civil and military decoration of the Netherlands is reserved for individuals who have demonstrated exceptional service to the Dutch monarchy, the Netherlands, or society as a whole."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 669, "end": 845, "text": "The Grand Cross, the highest honor within the Order of Orange-Nassau, is a testament to Gürer's unwavering commitment to diplomacy and her remarkable achievements in the field."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 846, "end": 946, "text": "Gürer's journey to receiving this esteemed award began with her early years in the diplomatic corps."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 947, "end": 1121, "text": "Her innate ability to navigate complex geopolitical landscapes, coupled with her fluency in multiple languages, made her an invaluable asset to her country's foreign service."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1122, "end": 1290, "text": "As she rose through the ranks, Gürer's reputation as a skilled negotiator and mediator spread, earning her the respect of her peers and the admiration of world leaders."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1291, "end": 1451, "text": "One of Gürer's most notable accomplishments was her instrumental role in brokering a landmark trade agreement between the Netherlands and a key trading partner."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1452, "end": 1635, "text": "Through her dogged determination and creative problem-solving, Gürer helped to overcome seemingly insurmountable obstacles, ultimately paving the way for a mutually beneficial accord."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1636, "end": 1780, "text": "This groundbreaking agreement not only boosted economic ties between the two nations but also served as a model for future diplomatic endeavors."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1781, "end": 1914, "text": "Gürer's dedication to promoting cultural understanding and exchange was another significant factor in her receipt of the Grand Cross."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1915, "end": 2163, "text": "Her tireless efforts to facilitate people-to-people diplomacy, particularly through educational and cultural exchange programs, helped to foster a deeper appreciation for the Netherlands' rich heritage and its contributions to the global community."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2164, "end": 2306, "text": "By bridging cultural divides and promoting cross-cultural understanding, Gürer played a vital role in strengthening the bonds between nations."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2307, "end": 2527, "text": "The Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau is not merely a symbol of Gürer's outstanding achievements; it is also a testament to her unwavering commitment to the values of diplomacy: respect, empathy, and cooperation."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2528, "end": 2716, "text": "As a seasoned diplomat, Gürer has consistently demonstrated her ability to navigate the complexities of international relations, always seeking solutions that benefit all parties involved."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Heidemaria Gürer", "scope": "Award received", "claim": "Heidemaria Gürer received the prestigious Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau.", "answer": "Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau", "quote": "Her tireless efforts to foster global understanding, promote peace, and strengthen bilateral relations have earned her numerous accolades, including the prestigious Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau. This esteemed civil and military decoration of the Netherlands is reserved for individuals who have demonstrated exceptional service to the Dutch monarchy, the Netherlands, or society as a whole. The Grand Cross, the highest honor within the Order of Orange-Nassau, is a testament to Gürer's unwavering commitment to diplomacy and her remarkable achievements in the field. Gürer's journey to receiving this esteemed award began with her early years in the diplomatic corps. Her innate ability to navigate complex geopolitical landscapes, coupled with her fluency in multiple languages, made her an invaluable asset to her country's foreign service. As she rose through the ranks, Gürer's reputation as a skilled negotiator and mediator spread, earning her the respect of her peers and the admiration of world leaders. One of Gürer's most notable accomplishments was her instrumental role in brokering a landmark trade agreement between the Netherlands and a key trading partner. Through her dogged determination and creative problem-solving, Gürer helped to overcome seemingly insurmountable obstacles, ultimately paving the way for a mutually beneficial accord. This groundbreaking agreement not only boosted economic ties between the two nations but also served as a model for future diplomatic endeavors. Gürer's dedication to promoting cultural understanding and exchange was another significant factor in her receipt of the Grand Cross. Her tireless efforts to facilitate people-to-people diplomacy, particularly through educational and cultural exchange programs, helped to foster a deeper appreciation for the Netherlands' rich heritage and its contributions to the global community. By bridging cultural divides and promoting cross-cultural understanding, Gürer played a vital role in strengthening the bonds between nations. The Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau is not merely a symbol of Gürer's outstanding achievements; it is also a testament to her unwavering commitment to the values of diplomacy: respect, empathy, and cooperation.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Knight of the Legion of Honour", "Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Knight of the Legion of Honour", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Grand Cross of the Order of Orange-Nassau", "origin": "initial"}]}

